<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπέμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send off in different directions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.48
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				84
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλους ἄλλῃ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.64
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρουρὰς κατὰ χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.55
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν ἰκμάδα</span> (through
			the body), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				681a30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					496a32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φωνὴν εἰς τὸ πρόσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					662b22
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>send out expeditions</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				199.35
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Adule</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>send over</i> or <i>across,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					398
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.123
				</span></i>
			; <i>transmit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				5ii19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.129
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.75
			</span></i> (possibly 
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				741.33
			</span></i> (Nysa, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθῆτά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.43
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>send messages,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ βοηθείας πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.72.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὺς φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arat.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
